  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3104.01 Governmental Approvals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3104.01 Governmental Approvals. No prior Federal, State, or local governmental approval shall be necessary for the use of DERs, except:\n\n(a) For DERs that shall be used for NSR offsets, State approval pursuant to Env-A 618 shall be required; and\n\n(b) Unique serial numbers shall be assigned by the division to each ton of DERs prior to use.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3100.html"
}
